{"ID":"20240205153753-38fyrh5","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153753-38fyrh5","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153753-38fyrh5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206083624-s8gldpe\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611162952-nli2pu5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206083624-s8gldpe\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"187萆薢","type":"doc","updated":"20240820105322"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206083624-s8gldpe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206083624-s8gldpe","updated":"20240206083625"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"粉萆薢"}]},{"ID":"20240206083637-86kdv60","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206083637-86kdv60","updated":"20240206083641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产湖南、浙江、江西、安徽等地。\n【性状】\t为不规则的薄片。边缘不整齐，大小不一，厚约0.5mm。有的有棕黑色或灰棕色的外皮。切面黄白色或灰棕色，维管束呈小点状散在。质松，略有弹性。气微，味辛、微苦。\n【性味】\t苦，平。\n【功效】\t利水，祛风，利湿。治风湿顽痹，腰膝疼痛，小便不利，淋浊，遗精，湿热疮毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240206083629-wsy3iw9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206083629-wsy3iw9","updated":"20240820095134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206083629-yhprfsk.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240625103452-hoquj0e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240625103452-hoquj0e","updated":"20240820102445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 329px;","style":"width: 319px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBra